{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656630/extras/plantes2.png?t=1745392400\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You're hiring more and more people in your small company!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But that's not all \u2014 you have to find a way to make them all fit in their workspace. And on top of having very different shapes and sizes, they also have specific requests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take George, for example: he always wants to be next to the coffee machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656630/extras/Gif1d.gif?t=1745392400\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or Gwen and Grace \u2014 they're inseparable. Don\u2019t even think about putting one on one side of the room and the other on the opposite side!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656630/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1745392400\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You get the idea \u2014 <i>Cosy Company Puzzle</i> is a challenging logic game! But in the end, everyone feels much better.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>20 handcrafted levels,</strong> some of which might really tickle your brain.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3 lo-fi and relaxing tracks</strong> to soothe your ears and create a calm, thoughtful atmosphere. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>10 characters</strong> with specific placement conditions and unique personalities.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><str